extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mhnYBcVKzh4Q7kNvwEochnN&_nc_oc=AdoookWngOhEej8hmVVC5zl93E_4EOT6Hz-_TrWKK2oQoy8rHpka392TnBD6UBC3PAM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLRvVvZasPhfhNLcddmuHXU3uhnIK2cp2L_06icXIPJqA&oe=6ABE7A56"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7s9XvirbcNoQ7kNvwHcu6bt&_nc_oc=AdrDlvgIeY071Wgrhl-243b2YvlVYxBdxVcYPgnrDeX8zNtDjo4G_tYXOmFIsdtruYc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQII2yZk7Luui41F4ZiUTRWGABi1Mr2flnTVc3yvO3lq-A&oe=6ABE81A2"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=24P-EpH4UgwQ7kNvwG9NdZB&_nc_oc=AdoJ41zVpLBTk-zpQBpvUvZdfHx_EjgUoDIGXfwALqZiET2727BnrOUgJgh3P5CzYEQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJa1yi74t68Wt24hNH-qPdW_0-7xe7XugPlBLrVwI_4Mg&oe=6ABE8999"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":